sentences.l:
Zixia said:
“Even in small ways there is surely something worth seeing;
carried far, one fears getting stuck — this is why the gentleman does not practise them.”

Zixia said:
“The hundred craftsmen keep to their workshops so as to complete their work;
the gentleman learns so as to carry his Way to the full.”

Zixia said:
“The gentleman has three changes:
seen from afar, dignified;
drawn near to, warm;
his words listened to, exacting.”

Zixia said:
“In great virtue, not overstepping the barrier;
in small virtue, going out and in is allowable.”

Zixia said:
“In office, and with strength to spare — then learn;
learning, and with strength to spare — then take office.”

Ziyou said:
“My friend Zhang does what is hard to be able to do;
and yet he is not yet humane.”

The Master's wall is several ren;
if one does not find its gate and go in,
one does not see the beauty of the ancestral temple,
the wealth of the hundred offices.

Chen Ziqin said to Zigong:
“You are being respectful, sir;
how could Zhongni be worthier than you?”

The Master's getting a state or a house —
(it would be) what is called: set them up, and they stand;
lead them, and they follow;
give them ease, and they come;
rouse them, and they are in concord;
his living, glory;
his dying, grief.
How could he be reached?
